<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan on oil services stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan on oil services stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Halliburton Co to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The firm also reiterated its strong buy ratings on Schlumberger Ltd and Baker Hughes Inc.</p>
<p>-- Halliburton was up 2-3/4 to 71-7/8, Schlumberger gained 2-1/8 to 112-1/2 and Baker Hughes rose 1-3/8 to 38.</p>
</text>
